<title>GUATEMALA: Guatemala sugar output 511,824 T Nov 1 thru -Feb 1.</title>
<headline>Guatemala sugar output 511,824 T Nov 1 thru -Feb 1.</headline>
<dateline>GUATEMALA CITY 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guatemala produced 511,824 tonnes of sugar between November 1, the beginning of the current harvest, and February 18, the Sugar Producers of the Central American Isthmus (AICA) said Friday.</p>
<p>In a faxed statement, AICA said Guatemala exported 393,711 tonnes -- 107,572 of raw sugar and 286,139 of white sugar -- in the same time period.</p>
<p>The principal destinations of Guatemala's sugar exports were the Ivory Coast, Chile, the United States, Haiti, Jamaica, Morocco, Mexico, Peru and Sri Lanka, the report said. It gave no tonnage breakdown per country.</p>
<p>((--Fiona Ortiz, Guatemala City bureau +502 251-5718))</p>
